harness.probe_source:
/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-AdCodicem-Pdf/b5ddd9fc-0507-5e11-8a94-c9e1fedd4860/scratchpad/r8proto/ZzProtoDiffTests.cs.txt (class ZzProtoDiffTests, [Fact] ZzProtoDiff). It compiles unchanged on 21a0298, d3ef236 and 012e13d.

Inputs:
- ZZ_PROTO_MANIFEST and ZZ_PROTO_OUT (required);
- ZZ_PROTO_LIMITS: a subset of limit sets;
- ZZ_PROTO_FILTER: a regular expression a path must match;
- ZZ_PROTO_THREADS: the thread count.

Each block opens with '=== <path> <limits>', followed by tab-separated lines:
- R open|asc|desc: WasRepaired at opening and after each order's reads;
- S: namedBy, namedOffset, offset, kind, state (FileStructure.Sections);
- D: severity, code, position, message (diagnostics at opening);
- O: number, asc value, desc value. The numbers are every 'n g obj' and 'n g R' number in the file's bytes, so the set does not depend on the variant. Values are a string's text, a number, stream, dict, null, array, /Name, a boolean, or THROW <type>. The ascending reads use one open, the descending reads a fresh one;
- A asc|desc: diagnostics added by those reads;
- F: severity, rule, location, message (validator findings on a fresh open);
- T: an exception (open, desc-open, validate, validate-open), with its type and message;
- X open-differs: the two opens disagree.

Limit sets: default, trailer100, trailer256, trailer1m (MaxTrailerLength), count2 (MaxXRefSectionCount), throw (ThrowOnLimit).

The writer probe that produced the C#-built shapes is saved at /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-AdCodicem-Pdf/b5ddd9fc-0507-5e11-8a94-c9e1fedd4860/scratchpad/r8proto/ZzProtoGenTests.cs.txt.

